HookNext is a visual Android Xposed module manager and runtime analysis tool. Configure Java/Smali method, argument, return-value, and field hooks without writing an Xposed module. It supports Root, Shizuku, and Normal work modes, hook records, DEX/APK/APKS browsing, extension hooks, LAN web management, MCP access, backup and restore, SimpleHook import, and Frida JavaScript export.
